Using Convex 1.44.0, schema.ts must declare users and messages with the fields below.

```ts
import { defineSchema, defineTable } from "convex/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";
const users = { name: v.string() };
const messages = { text: v.string(), authorName: v.string() };
```

options.text:
```ts
export default defineSchema({ users: defineTable(users), messages: defineTable(messages) });
```

```ts
export default defineSchema({ users: v.object(users), messages: v.object(messages) });
```

```ts
export default { users: defineTable(users), messages: defineTable(messages) };
```
